      "funding_type": "grant",
      "typical_award_size": "HCD formula allocations to the County: $371,543 (2024) and $407,167 (2025); the City of Merced holds its own allocation ($364,106 in 2024, $390,011 in 2025, estimated $2,275,663 for 2024-2028). The County's PLHA five-year plan and spending could not be read (County website blocked).",
